Description: VeltOS Automatic Repair, like Windows 11's recovery
 When VeltOS does not finish starting twice in a row, the PC starts
 Automatic Repair by itself, as Windows does: a full-screen window in the
 layout of Windows 11's recovery screens with Restart and Advanced options
 (Startup Repair, Safe mode, Command Prompt, the last start's problems,
 Continue, Turn off), in English and Turkish.
 .
 GRUB counts the starts (veltos-boot), this package clears the count once
 the sign-in screen is up, restarts the PC when a start ends in emergency
 mode or the sign-in screen keeps failing, and keeps the system journal on
 disk so the problems of a failed start can be shown.
